# Modal Footer Buttons (50% / 50%)

For popup/modals that have primary cancel/close and confirm/save actions:

- Put **إغلاق / تراجع / Cancel** and **حفظ / نعم / Save** in one row
- Each button takes **50% of the modal width** (`basis-1/2` + `w-full` on the button)
- Do not leave them as small auto-width buttons on the sides

```html
<div class="flex flex-row w-full">
  <div class="basis-1/2 px-2">
    <button class="w-full py-3 bg-gray-500 text-white rounded">إغلاق</button>
  </div>
  <div class="basis-1/2 px-2">
    <button class="w-full py-3 bg-rose-600 text-white rounded">حفظ</button>
  </div>
</div>
```

Secondary actions (طباعة، إلخ) go **above** that row as full-width, not squeezed beside the 50/50 pair.

Apply this pattern to every new or edited modal.
